                                                "sense_id": "2e68c249-9e85-3ff4-88f8-7cfa48ecf743",
                                                "text": "It was night once more and Mary had got through another day without throwing herself politely from a top floor window or scrawling filthy words on the dining room walls."
                                            }
                                        ]
